  <participating-org role="4" type="90">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">VCCI Can Tho</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Vietnam Chamber of Commerce and Industry Branch in Can Tho represents for motivating and protecting legal rights of business community and employers in Mekong Delta in terms of domestic and international relationship. The organization aims to motivate (1) The development of enterprises and entrepreneurship; (2) The link creation between enterprises and business associations; and (3) The promotion and support for trading, investments, cooperation in science &#x2013; technology and other business activities. Their missions are including:
- To improve business environment so as to enhance the competitiveness for provinces in Mekong Delta through building up thedatabase serving for economics, international economic integration and scientific research for regionaleconomic development.
- To represent for Vietnamese employers to maintain the harmony relationship in companies.
To promote trade, investment and tourism in Mekong Delta, connect the enterprises looking for business opportunities, selling, buying or investment partners in domestic and international markets by organizing conferences, PPP and forums.
- To issue the Certificate of Origin (C/O)for export and import firms.
Topropose solutions for commercial disputes through negotiations via Vietnam International Arbitration Centre (VIAC) at the Vietnam Chamber of Commerce and Industry (VCCI).
- To consult on the registration, protection of intellectual property rights and technology transfer in Vietnam and foreign countries as well, business strategy, business management and investment project in marketing and production development.
- To train human resources for business community in fields of administration, finance, accountant, sciences and many in-house programs.
- To provide all types of businessdevelopment services (BDS) such as providing business&#x2019;s information, statistics data related to Mekong Delta&#x2019;s economy, scientific - technological &#x2013; environmental information, doing market surveys,  several IT services such as website design, software management, accountant, network administration, website administration and so on.</narrative>
  </participating-org>
